#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:16 f7bdfc9809c748c0b8361d8f823b3ed3
msgid "Represents a single playing channel (voice) in FMOD."
msgstr "单个播放通道的控制对象"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:21 f03cd4219c8f4726bc31f2b4a5bc2a67
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:23 1761fa8354c449adb2ac957f202bb8a1
msgid ""
"FmodChannel represents an active voice in the FMOD mixer. When a sound is played via "
":ref:`FmodSystem.play_sound()<class_FmodSystem_method_play_sound>`, FMOD allocates a channel to "
"play that sound. This class provides control over playback parameters such as frequency, "
"position, looping, and virtual voice priority."
msgstr ""
"**FmodChannel**    表示 FMOD 中一次实际或虚拟的声音播放实例。它继承    ``FmodChannelControl``    "
"的通用控制能力，并额外提供播放频率、优先级、播放位置、循环点、所属 ChannelGroup、当前声音和通道索引等接口。 （参见   "
":ref:`FmodSystem.play_sound()<class_FmodSystem_method_play_sound>`  ）"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:25 0ce343a66c4b4c1c8f72861a4ae76ea0
msgid ""
"Channels are automatically managed by FMOD's virtual voice system. When there are more sounds "
"playing than physical voices available, lower-priority channels may be \"virtualized\" (silently "
"processed in the background without consuming hardware resources)."
msgstr "FMOD 的虚拟声部系统会自动管理通道。播放的声音多于物理声部时，低优先级通道可能转为虚拟声部，在后台静默处理且不占用硬件声部。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:27 6f2ae88efb404166b4a0012e75fa9a14
msgid ""
"\\ **Note:** This class extends :ref:`FmodChannelControl<class_FmodChannelControl>`, which "
"provides additional functionality including volume, pitch, pan, 3D positioning, DSP effects, and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"**注意：**    继承自    :ref:`FmodChannelControl<class_FmodChannelControl>`   ，可使用其音量、音高、声像、三维定位和 DSP "
"等功能。"

