#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:122 2fa5e89e62414c1ab9bb6cf0651a3d62
msgid "Emitted when this channel becomes virtualized or returns to being a real voice."
msgstr "通道转为虚拟声部，或恢复为实际声部时发出。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:124 51aeb06cdd0b40b2971bea22a9c1dc29
msgid "``true``: The channel is becoming virtual (silently processing without hardware voice)"
msgstr "``true``   ：正在转为虚拟声部，静默处理且不占用硬件声部"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:126 a6a2fa3c1013447fb459a63619f26068
msgid "``false``: The channel is becoming real (has been assigned a hardware voice)"
msgstr "``false``   ：正在恢复为实际声部，已分配硬件声部"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:128 d60f751402b74e8685cc0cfd87fd6f7b
msgid "This happens automatically as part of FMOD's virtual voice system when there are more"
msgstr "播放的声音数超过可用物理声部时，FMOD 的虚拟声部系统会自动调整。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:130 ea493bb52311433793b8c162d00747be
msgid ""
"playing sounds than available physical voices. Channels with lower "
":ref:`priority<class_FmodChannel_property_priority>`"
msgstr "播放的声音超过可用物理声部时，   :ref:`priority<class_FmodChannel_property_priority>`    较低的通道"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:132 0355266c457447e4a9eae24e662eec94
msgid "are more likely to become virtualized."
msgstr "更容易转为虚拟声部。"

