#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:144 ce11aaf6f0614e7983769ccf28248b88
msgid "Emitted when a sync point embedded in the sound file is reached."
msgstr "到达声音文件中嵌入的同步点时发出。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:146 04ec391ff495460eabbc7b2840a69b46
msgid "Sync points are markers that can be embedded in audio files to trigger events at specific times."
msgstr "同步点是嵌入音频文件中的标记，可在指定时刻触发事件。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:148 75082d7a1b304e2bb05f4727b3cc950e
msgid "The ``sync_point_index`` parameter indicates which sync point was triggered."
msgstr "``sync_point_index``    表示触发的同步点索引。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:150 d60772c5ba32412e92b4d0bb4fb02e4e
msgid ""
"Pass it to :ref:`FmodSound.get_sync_point()<class_FmodSound_method_get_sync_point>` to get the "
"sync point handle, which can then be used with "
":ref:`FmodSound.get_sync_point_info()<class_FmodSound_method_get_sync_point_info>` to retrieve "
"the sync point's name and offset."
msgstr ""
"将索引传给    :ref:`FmodSound.get_sync_point()<class_FmodSound_method_get_sync_point>`    获取同步点句柄，再调用"
"    :ref:`FmodSound.get_sync_point_info()<class_FmodSound_method_get_sync_point_info>`    "
"查询同步点名称和偏移。"

