"``reverb_occlusion``: Occlusion factor for reverberant sound (0.0 = no occlusion, 1.0 = fully "
"occluded)"
msgstr "``reverb_occlusion``   ：混响声遮挡，0.0 为无遮挡，1.0 为完全遮挡"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:170 1e8b2ab3b7c34172bf76ce6ae04c5f11
msgid "Higher occlusion values typically result in muffled sound (low-pass filtering)."
msgstr "遮挡值越高，声音通常越闷，表现为低通滤波。"

