"When virtualized, the channel continues to process silently in the background without consuming a"
" hardware voice."
msgstr "虚拟化后，通道会在后台继续静默处理，不占用硬件声部。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannel.rst:586 4b39dd513fa64cf790fcb68f3c35a49d
